@startuml
actor Student
participant "LearningController" as Controller
participant "ConceptExtractionService" as Service
participant "CourseMaterialService" as Material
participant "PromptBuilder" as Prompt
participant "LlmClient" as Llm
participant "StructuredResponseParser" as Parser
Student -> Controller: request concepts
Controller -> Service: extract(course, document)
Service -> Material: validate ownership/readiness and load ordered chunks
Service -> Prompt: buildConceptExtractionPrompt
Service -> Llm: checkAvailability/generate
Service -> Parser: parse structured JSON
Service -> Service: validate sources and deduplicate names
Service --> Controller: ExtractedConcept list
Controller --> Student: escaped concepts and source metadata
@enduml
